From f80fa49d8850c205f03c2e4b3844ba56b880462d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
by: triplecN
Subject: [PATCH 04/20] RandomX proof of work (CMake)

RandomX v1 in light mode over the 80-byte header replaces SHA256d as the
proof of work, with a startup known-answer self-test and a hard failure if
the library is missing.
---
